OL,3,ABali police investigate after
OL,4,AAustralian man and children found dead
OL,5,Ain home
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice in Bali are investigating after
OL,8,Fthe bodies of an Australian man and his
OL,9,Ftwo children were found dead in their
OL,10,Fbungalow in a popular tourist area.
OL,12,FDamien John Shaw, 56, and his two
OL,13,Fchildren, a boy aged six and a girl
OL,14,Faged four, were found dead in their
OL,15,Fhome in Kuta on Sunday.
OL,17,FPolice said neighbours had checked in
OL,18,Fon the family after a call from the
OL,19,Fman's wife, who had become concerned
OL,20,Fafter a phone call with her husband.
OL,21,FShe was not in Bali at the time.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
