OL,3,ABali police investigate after
OL,4,AAustralian man and children found dead
OL,5,Ain home
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralian media reported that police
OL,8,Fwere treating the case as a suspected
OL,9,Fmurder-suicide. Police told the BBC
OL,10,Fthey had not yet determined the cause
OL,11,For manner of death and that further
OL,12,Fexaminations would be carried out.
